  "DivisionNotes": [
    "AnimInit is in OperatorDefNames_Init (name starts with Init).",
    "AnimSpec is in OperatorDefNames_TemporalProperty because its body uses [] in [][AnimNext]_Animvars and a fairness operator WF.",
    "AnimInv is a state predicate (terminationDetected => TLCGet(\"level\") < 20) without primes or temporal outer operators.",
    "Action operators (AnimInitiateProbe, AnimPassToken, AnimSystem, AnimSendMsg, AnimDeactivate, AnimEnvironment, AnimNext) prime variables and/or are disjunctions of actions; the remaining operators define structural/UI values and are placed in OperatorDefNames_ValueDef.",
    "TemporalNesting is false: only flat [][Next]_vars /\\ WF_vars(_) is used at the top level.",
    "FunctionConstructor [active EXCEPT ![j] = TRUE] is technically EXCEPT-form; both EXCEPT and lambda function constructors are present, lambda-form (ByDomain) is absent in this module's source though present via inherited operators."
  ]
